  "claim": "Industrialist August Heckscher established a museum in Heckscher Park that features \"First Friday\" concerts.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Heckscher Park (Huntington, New York). Sentence: Heckscher Park is a local park and national historic district in Huntington, Suffolk County, New York.\nPage: Heckscher Park (Huntington, New York). Sentence: The park is roughly triangular-shaped with a large pond on northwest corner, and contains the Heckscher Museum of Art established by industrialist August Heckscher, as well as the Chapin Rainbow Theater.\nPage: Heckscher Museum of Art. Sentence: Additionally, public programs for adults, families, and children, include \"First Friday\" concert series, gallery talks, festivals and workshops.",
